                </div>
                <div class="message received">
                    <span class="sender">Socrates:</span>
                    <p>Ah, a wise observation. Let us delve deeper into this topic.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="message sent">
                    <span class="sender">You:</span>
                    <p>Indeed. How do we distinguish between true knowledge and mere opinion?</p>
                </div> -->
